# Ensure consistent line endings (matches bouncerdata/.gitattributes).
#
# R/versebus.R is vendored from torpverse/torp and kept in sync by a plain
# file diff (see the header of that file). This working tree had checked out
# CRLF while bouncer's had LF, so the prescribed
#   diff bouncer/R/versebus.R bouncermodels/R/versebus.R
# reported all 652 lines as changed even when the content was identical --
# making the drift check useless. Both indexes already stored LF; this stops
# the working tree diverging again.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.R text eol=lf
*.Rd text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
